offer.body=Give me a lodge and a clear arena. We can bind creatures to a portal, one at a time, and see how long I can stand against them. Bring samples from your travels to unlock new creatures. I collect their spoils for the town.
accepted.body=Here is the lodge plan. Leave the floor around the Hunt Beacon clear. The spectators belong outside the railing.
cancel=I need to put this project aside.
building.body=I will keep my things packed until the hunting lodge is ready. The plot plan lists the materials we need.
cancelled.body=All right. Find me when you are ready to begin again.
back=Understood.
welcome.body=The arena is ready. Ask me about survival runs. Every run costs treasury gold and begins at your command. Train me between runs and unlock creatures with gold and their drops.
how.body=I fight one creature at a time until I go down. Each wave is harder. When I fall, the portal closes and I return immediately, ready for your next run. There is no need to visit Gaia. Collected spoils remain in the lodge. Nothing starts again without your order.
gift.confirm=You brought something for me? Let me see.
